Update on the project:



Local legal counsels have provided their input under blocking matrix for premium policy removal [HERE|https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1xnyrquWBJOHJ0WNKFohWvIii23KQH6fV_1TMeYZ3l-8/edit?gid=19905251#gid=19905251]. Summarised legal feedback (remove policy or not for low AR) is following:

* for risk class 3 markets it is strongly recommended NOT to remove premium policy for low AR couriers
* for most of the risk class 2 markets it is okey to remove the premium policy if we don’t prominently notify couriers about it in the app or somewhere else. It is ok to answer to courier questions about the low AR and premium policy removal if they turn to CS on this topic. Communication on that part should be approved by legal if implemented.
* for all risk class 1 markets it is okey to remove the premium policy and notify couriers about it. Communication on that part should be approved by legal if implemented.

