* a written consent signed by you as data subject;
* a certified copy of a power of attorney;
* or other proof of legal authority.

{quote}Please be aware that we are unable to respond to your request until we receive the additional information specified above upon your reply to this email.Alternatively, please use one of the several channels available, such as requesting your data erasure directly via your application, or through your profile’s email request sent to our Customer Support Team.We appreciate your cooperation in this matter and look forward to receiving the requested information from you.Yours sincerely,
Bolt{quote}

{{Template 2}}

{quote}Dear [NAME],We have been unable to verify the third party's legal authority to make a request on your behalf. Therefore, we are unable to process your request to use an unauthorised third party application.We ask you to raise a request by an alternative means - please use one of the several channels available, such as requesting your data erasure directly via your application, or through your profile's email request sent to our Customer Support Team.If you are dissatisfied with this response to your request or in relation to any other matter relating to the processing of your personal data, we hope you will continue to work with us to resolve them.You also have the right to complain directly to your data protection/supervisory authority and, depending on the applicable data protection laws in your country, to seek a judicial remedy.If you have any additional questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to our Support Team.Yours sincerely,
Bolt{quote}

